      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "The filled support link in the espresso hero.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-hero\"><a class=\"ds-primary\" href=\"https://beanzen.ru/support/\">Get support <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></div>",
      "css": "@font-face{font-family:Manrope;src:url(https://beanzen.ru/assets/fonts/manrope-variable.ttf) format(\"truetype\");font-weight:200 800;font-style:normal;font-display:swap;}a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #947345;outline-offset:5px;}a{ text-underline-offset:5px;} .ds-hero{background:#35251d;padding:24px;}.ds-primary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;min-height:50px;padding:12px 20px;background:#f1e5d0;color:#35251d;font:700 16px/1.65 Manrope,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;transition:background-color .2s;}.ds-primary:hover{background:#fff5e3;text-decoration:none;}@media(max-width:700px){.ds-primary{font-size:14.5px;}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-primary{transition:none;}}"
