      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "Light hero navigation with a distinct active language.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-nav-surface\"><nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a href=\"https://beanzen.ru/\" aria-current=\"page\">The app</a><a href=\"https://beanzen.ru/support/\">Support</a><a href=\"https://beanzen.ru/privacy/\">Privacy</a></nav><nav class=\"ds-language\" aria-label=\"Language\"><a href=\"https://beanzen.ru/\" lang=\"en\" aria-current=\"true\">EN</a><a href=\"https://beanzen.ru/ru/\" lang=\"ru\">RU</a></nav></div>",
      "css": "@font-face{font-family:Manrope;src:url(https://beanzen.ru/assets/fonts/manrope-variable.ttf) format(\"truetype\");font-weight:200 800;font-style:normal;font-display:swap;}a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #947345;outline-offset:5px;}a{ text-underline-offset:5px;} .ds-nav-surface{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:32px;background:#35251d;padding:24px;font-family:Manrope,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;line-height:1.65;}.ds-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:28px;}.ds-nav a{color:#eee4d7;font-size:15.5px;text-decoration:none;}.ds-nav a:hover,.ds-nav a[aria-current]{color:#fff;text-decoration:underline;}.ds-language{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-shrink:0;font-size:15px;}.ds-language a{color:#ddcbb6;padding:8px 0;text-decoration:none;}.ds-language a:hover{text-decoration:underline;}.ds-language a[aria-current]{color:#fff;font-weight:800;text-decoration:underline;}@media(max-width:700px){.ds-nav-surface{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;}.ds-nav{order:3;width:100%;gap:12px 24px;}.ds-nav a{font-size:14px;}.ds-language{margin-left:auto;font-size:13.5px;}}"
